<p class="govuk-body"><a class="govuk-link" href="/probation-officer" data-tracking-id="licence_condition_help_tell_probation_officer_link">Your probation officer</a> will tell you what details to give them and when to do it by.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">If you need to tell them about any relationships, they will tell you what they mean by relationship and what you need to tell them.</p>
